⭐ 15. Rewrite for Toxicity Removal
📄 rewrite_15_toxicity_removal.md
Original:
“You’re useless and terrible at your job.”

Rewrite (Constructive):
“I’m having trouble with the results. Could we review the work together?”

⭐ 16. Rewrite for Structure Improvement
📄 rewrite_16_structure.md
Original:
“I tried fixing the issue but then something else broke and now nothing works.”

Rewrite (Structured):
“I attempted to fix the issue, but a new problem occurred, and now the system isn’t functioning.”

⭐ 17. Rewrite for Readability
📄 rewrite_17_readability.md
Original:
“The aforementioned circumstances have resulted in a situation that is less than ideal.”

Rewrite (Readable):
“These circumstances have created a difficult situation.”

⭐ 18. Academic Rewrite
📄 rewrite_18_academic.md
Original:
“Kids learn better when they’re interested.”

Rewrite (Academic):
“Student engagement significantly enhances learning outcomes, as intrinsic interest improves attention and retention.”

⭐ 19. Customer‑Service Rewrite
📄 rewrite_19_customer_service.md
Original:
“Your order is late. Not my problem.”

Rewrite (Customer‑Friendly):
“I’m sorry your order is delayed. Let me check the status and help resolve this.”

